# LF everywhere, on every OS. The server is Linux and reads the systemd unit, the nginx
# config and shell snippets straight from the checkout; on Windows core.autocrlf would
# otherwise keep the working copy in CRLF and warn about it on every `git add`.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.woff2 binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
